            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "This is by design: anchor path for `MiniFiles.open()` should be a present path on disk. There is no fallbacks. Use explicit call [which includes directory](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/64e95aa77587d04f97a5579b2106a82a08a7d968/doc/mini-files.txt#L694-L708).\r\n\r\nDuplicate of #840 and #848.",
